        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Genera: Rapanea, Styrax\n- Products: Benzoin (resin)\n- Concepts: taxonomic relationship, species counts\n\nFacts:\n- Styrax is the genus to which Benzoin resin belongs.\n- The genus closely related to Rapanea has twenty more species than Styrax.\n- Therefore, the genus closely related to Rapanea has a species count equal to Styrax plus twenty.",
